{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 30, "width": 2880, "height": 1057, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 1347871629, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 726279855, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "Hv0rFvz8gBnv9uLATBkA", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 883.3000000000001, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1752604882, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 843537087, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Analytics dashboard for an AI chat app: one output topic, three consumers", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Analytics dashboard for an AI chat app: one output topic, three consumers", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "HArUY7DitsRDY03T31qQ", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 662.2, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 297494815, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1708795964, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements (ask first)\n- three metrics per persona? freshness per persona (s / min / day)?\n- DAU and messages per user? may we store chat content (no)?\n- retention: warm 360 d, cold beyond? GDPR erasure SLA? HIPAA for Support?\nEngineering: per-model p50/p99, error rate, model usage, queue depth, GPU util, alerts\nProduct: DAU/WAU, session length, retention, thumbs, revenue by plan\nSupport: per-user timeline of sessions and errors, never the content", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements (ask first)\n- three metrics per persona? freshness per persona (s / min / day)?\n- DAU and messages per user? may we store chat content (no)?\n- retention: warm 360 d, cold beyond? GDPR erasure SLA? HIPAA for Support?\nEngineering: per-model p50/p99, error rate, model usage, queue depth, GPU util, alerts\nProduct: DAU/WAU, session length, retention, thumbs, revenue by plan\nSupport: per-user timeline of sessions and errors, never the content", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kMArMjU08NTPPaUyzIBr", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 170.5, "width": 631.4000000000001, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 40744656, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207529024, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Technical challenges\n- isolation: analytics never degrades chat (fire-and-forget, drop analytics first)\n- freshness 1-5 s for health; <50 ms only on the hot query path\n- privacy: no content, tokenised identity, erasure keeps aggregates\n- 30M DAU x 20 msgs x 5 events = 3B/day = 35k/s avg, 150k/s peak, ~1 TB/day\n- cardinality: model x region x plan x client version; retention cost", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Technical challenges\n- isolation: analytics never degrades chat (fire-and-forget, drop analytics first)\n- freshness 1-5 s for health; <50 ms only on the hot query path\n- privacy: no content, tokenised identity, erasure keeps aggregates\n- 30M DAU x 20 msgs x 5 events = 3B/day = 35k/s avg, 150k/s peak, ~1 TB/day\n- cardinality: model x region x plan x client version; retention cost", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "SVtaM26FakBoblEhgkcW", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 303.5, "width": 631.4000000000001, "height": 175.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 959268664, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 866561460, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities\nEvent(event_id UUIDv7, type, schema_version, ts_event, ts_ingest, source,\n      session_id, user_token, request_id, model, region, plan, client_version,\n      measures{latency_ms, tokens_in/out, status}, attributes{}, sensitivity tags)\nSession(session_id, user_token, start, end, client, origin)\nPrivacyToken(user_id -> token, key, created_at, revoked_at)\nRollup(metric, window 1s|1m|1h|1d, dims, count, sum, p50, p99 sketch, watermark)\nDashboard(id, audience, widgets[])   AlertRule(id, metric, condition, window,\n      group_by, tier nrt|fast|slow, channel, escalation)\nNot entities: the chat message, the GPU (a dimension)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities\nEvent(event_id UUIDv7, type, schema_version, ts_event, ts_ingest, source,\n      session_id, user_token, request_id, model, region, plan, client_version,\n      measures{latency_ms, tokens_in/out, status}, attributes{}, sensitivity tags)\nSession(session_id, user_token, start, end, client, origin)\nPrivacyToken(user_id -> token, key, created_at, revoked_at)\nRollup(metric, window 1s|1m|1h|1d, dims, count, sum, p50, p99 sketch, watermark)\nDashboard(id, audience, widgets[])   AlertRule(id, metric, condition, window,\n      group_by, tier nrt|fast|slow, channel, escalation)\nNot entities: the chat message, the GPU (a dimension)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "m1H6oZahRpoz83zJkzhd", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 506.5, "width": 531.3000000000001, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1764013660, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2147323291, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /v1/events (batch, fire-and-forget, 202, idempotent on event_id)\nGET /v1/metrics?metric&dims&window&from&to -> rollups (cached)\nGET /v1/sessions/{id}/timeline (Support, RBAC, no content)\nPOST /v1/dashboards   POST /v1/alerts\nDELETE /v1/users/{id}/privacy-token (GDPR erasure = shred the key)\ninternal: GET /schemas/{type}/{version}; evaluator reads rollups", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /v1/events (batch, fire-and-forget, 202, idempotent on event_id)\nGET /v1/metrics?metric&dims&window&from&to -> rollups (cached)\nGET /v1/sessions/{id}/timeline (Support, RBAC, no content)\nPOST /v1/dashboards   POST /v1/alerts\nDELETE /v1/users/{id}/privacy-token (GDPR erasure = shred the key)\ninternal: GET /schemas/{type}/{version}; evaluator reads rollups", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "WbuikMzFfmDcZKYB1Fvk", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 657.0, "width": 616.0, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 1957485970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 227365513, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\n- analytics on the chat request path -> emit async, local buffer, drop analytics\n- slow ad-hoc scan stalls the on-call dashboard -> workload isolation\n- one bad client version 10x events -> per-source quotas, sampling, quarantine\n- erasure by deleting rows -> aggregates vanish; shred the token key instead", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\n- analytics on the chat request path -> emit async, local buffer, drop analytics\n- slow ad-hoc scan stalls the on-call dashboard -> workload isolation\n- one bad client version 10x events -> per-source quotas, sampling, quarantine\n- erasure by deleting rows -> aggregates vanish; shred the token key instead", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "N5TQd5onl1kmXtwjlYA5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1073748261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1081315664, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "HtCmhkKIOeYg3mc9ZWVt"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "6vI9e64PRBIFbSm4qxbM"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "xQc59uEbB61IJXKQxcSr"}], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "HtCmhkKIOeYg3mc9ZWVt", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 290346456, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1230983126, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Event sources\ngateway \u00b7 orchestrator \u00b7 inference\nclient SDK \u00b7 infra agents (GPU, queues)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "N5TQd5onl1kmXtwjlYA5", "originalText": "Event sources\ngateway \u00b7 orchestrator \u00b7 inference\nclient SDK \u00b7 infra agents (GPU, queues)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "NN0vTAhQr0MHiGRFBtnB", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0009", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 899243749, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 911639389, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "yxFZm6CwFGIpToonpmN9"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "6vI9e64PRBIFbSm4qxbM"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "9FIGcJ6UvsJMVDVLeUsV"}], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "yxFZm6CwFGIpToonpmN9", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0010", "roundness": null, "seed": 181596386, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 457473535, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Collector (per region)\nbuffer 5\u201310 ms, batch, validate lightly\nbackpressure: drop analytics, never chat", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "NN0vTAhQr0MHiGRFBtnB", "originalText": "Collector (per region)\nbuffer 5\u201310 ms, batch, validate lightly\nbackpressure: drop analytics, never chat", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3AiqTRNyJefXgMskW2tj", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ede9fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0011", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1979852483, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 693638970, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "g7bFka9QRVWLPtgTTTOf"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "9FIGcJ6UvsJMVDVLeUsV"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "xAp1jP2ZnkDgCTznzFIe"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "JdMaujnzYneFSTRaHRIx"}], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "g7bFka9QRVWLPtgTTTOf", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0012", "roundness": null, "seed": 1201941312, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 368917497, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ingest topic (Kafka)\nraw events, partition by session_id\nacks=1 \u00b7 replayable \u00b7 7 d", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "3AiqTRNyJefXgMskW2tj", "originalText": "Ingest topic (Kafka)\nraw events, partition by session_id\nacks=1 \u00b7 replayable \u00b7 7 d", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "UQJIHWXBP68QoVmLYa6w", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1980, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0013", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 513473836, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1100326025, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "KRoBL87g6XnmFrtzHHcA"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "xAp1jP2ZnkDgCTznzFIe"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "WSYt6uw60EEiv5ri5js3"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "Kv9JjcWmaMVJB1HmlDgZ"}], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "KRoBL87g6XnmFrtzHHcA", "type": "text", "x": 1990, "y": 260.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0014", "roundness": null, "seed": 956274209, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1371065736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stream processor (Flink)\nschema check \u00b7 dedupe on event_id\n1 s + 1 min rollups, p99 sketches\nwatermarks for late events", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "UQJIHWXBP68QoVmLYa6w", "originalText": "Stream processor (Flink)\nschema check \u00b7 dedupe on event_id\n1 s + 1 min rollups, p99 sketches\nwatermarks for late events", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "iivpZc5LTqFnVHqtbfK9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dcfce7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0015", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 861388080, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1429320608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "eoZ3pjkbqwIQ67VqNVfP"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "WSYt6uw60EEiv5ri5js3"}], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "eoZ3pjkbqwIQ67VqNVfP", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 75.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0016", "roundness": null, "seed": 655468740, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 121192252, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Schema registry\nevent types, versions,\nsensitivity tags per field", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "iivpZc5LTqFnVHqtbfK9", "originalText": "Schema registry\nevent types, versions,\nsensitivity tags per field", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0SLE0b5woaXbZo8L9dv9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dcfce7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWi