, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50], [-1220, 50], [-1220, -5.0], [-1260, -5.0]], "startBinding": {"elementId": "cgUKbtPuQRgd86GG2yjV", "mode": "orbit", "fixedPoint": [0.10526315789473684, 0.9090909090909091]}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "8ulasCJ8FgT1WV5tS1RN", "mode": "orbit", "fixedPoint": [1, 0.7727272727272727]}, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false}, {"id": "3OJgl0HnSdmaSdSpF7sr", "type": "text", "x": 740, "y": 781.0, "width": 28.6, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0066", "roundness": null, "seed": 1832250940, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1333425669, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "scan", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "scan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "mE0QfNtwPMsCeqU7NA4O", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 840, "width": 2079.0, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0067", "roundness": null, "seed": 658944798, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1363155902, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure / probes: analytics on the chat path \u2192 async emit + local buffer, shed analytics first. Ad-hoc scan stalls on-call \u2192 workload isolation. Client version sends 10\u00d7 \u2192 per-source quota, sampling, quarantine. Erasure by row deletes kills trends \u2192 shred the token key.\nSupport must never see content \u2192 content is never emitted; timeline view behind RBAC with an audit log.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure / probes: analytics on the chat path \u2192 async emit + local buffer, shed analytics first. Ad-hoc scan stalls on-call \u2192 workload isolation. Client version sends 10\u00d7 \u2192 per-source quota, sampling, quarantine. Erasure by row deletes kills trends \u2192 shred the token key.\nSupport must never see content \u2192 content is never emitted; timeline view behind RBAC with an audit log.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "eEykQZczP9YyFiPiUnUP", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 905, "width": 2156.0, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0068", "roundness": null, "seed": 134364867, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 394137897, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say: 30M DAU \u00b7 20 messages \u00b7 5 events \u2192 3B/day \u2192 35k/s average, 150k/s peak \u00b7 300 B/event \u2192 1 TB/day raw \u00b7 warm 360 d \u2248 360 TB raw, rollups GBs/day \u00b7 freshness 1\u20135 s end to end; <50 ms is the cached rollup query \u00b7 collector flush 5\u201310 ms \u00b7 Kafka acks=1 single-digit ms.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say: 30M DAU \u00b7 20 messages \u00b7 5 events \u2192 3B/day \u2192 35k/s average, 150k/s peak \u00b7 300 B/event \u2192 1 TB/day raw \u00b7 warm 360 d \u2248 360 TB raw, rollups GBs/day \u00b7 freshness 1\u20135 s end to end; <50 ms is the cached rollup query \u00b7 collector flush 5\u201310 ms \u00b7 Kafka acks=1 single-digit ms.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "CGo7SP1bV889MgyqRnm5", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 955, "width": 2071.3, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0069", "roundness": null, "seed": 1377202359, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1229919730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Alert tiers: <10 s streaming on 1-s rollups \u2192 pager (p99 latency, error rate per model) \u00b7 <60 s 1-min rollups every 15 s \u2192 chat/on-call (GPU util, queue depth) \u00b7 <1 day batch on the lake \u2192 email/ticket (retention, revenue drift, cost). Dedupe, group, silence, escalate.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Alert tiers: <10 s streaming on 1-s rollups \u2192 pager (p99 latency, error rate per model) \u00b7 <60 s 1-min rollups every 15 s \u2192 chat/on-call (GPU util, queue depth) \u00b7 <1 day batch on the lake \u2192 email/ticket (retention, revenue drift, cost). Dedupe, group, silence, escalate.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "pb3HbCLt5bWaNgwpt22Y", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 1005, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "XmonvqdLTb71RNHOJGwI", "index": "a0070", "roundness": null, "seed": 309615545, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1891468396, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790775836258, "created": 1790775836258, "link": null, "locked": fals